cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Search Right Home Service Cost Index"
abstract: >-
  113 sourced U.S. household-service cost records across 22 trades, each carrying a figure,
  the publisher it came from, that publisher's own date, and a figure kind that constrains
  what the number may be used to claim. 12 records are whole-job low-high ranges; the rest
  are annual running costs, worker wages, single averages, state-average spreads, a combined
  benchmark, a unit price, or carry no dollar figure at all.
authors:
  - name: "Search Right"
    website: "https://www.searchright.io"
type: dataset
version: "2026-11"
date-released: "2026-11-08"
license: CC-BY-4.0
